      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "KYVALLEY MICHAEL NZ (8) continues a run of second line draws but has been going very well from there. Found the front from this barrier before scoring by more than 6m two back then missed narrowly last time, both at this circuit and distance. Can continue the strong form. SEBASTIANS BOY (4) did a good job to come from the back row and miss by only 1.7m last start. Gets his best draw of the campaign so far and should be at peak fitness now. SCAR (7) has never managed to win in 14 tries here but he does return in top form, coming from similar barriers to win his last two outings. TICTOK (10) could be close to a win following back-to-back placings, one when coming from this barrier at this circuit and distance. KYVALLEY JETSTREAM NZ (2) draws well for his return and has been trialling well so keep him safe.",
